.TH RFID-BIND-BLUETOOTH-KEYBOARD-PAIR 1 "2026-07-28" "GWAY local tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rfid-bind-bluetooth-keyboard-pair \- bind an RFID card to Bluetooth keyboard pairing
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rfid-bind-bluetooth-keyboard-pair
.RB ( --wait | --latest | --card
.IR CARD )
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates a hold action under the selected RFID card directory. Holding that card
opens a bounded Bluetooth keyboard pairing window.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --wait
Wait for the next card.
.TP
.B --latest
Use the latest scan.
.TP
.BI --card " CARD"
Bind a specific card ID.
.TP
.B --force
Replace existing files.
.TP
.B --dry-run
Print intended changes without writing them.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rfid-bluetooth-keyboard-pair (1),
.BR rfid-register (1)
